<meta name="description" content="Environmental, Social and Governance [ESG] Rating providers offer activities including the issuance, and the publication or distribution of ESG ratings on a professional basis. ESMA is the direct supervisor of ESG Rating providers offering their services within the EU, under Regulation (EU) 2024/3005 (‘ESG Ratings Regulation’)." />
